WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
I don't know

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:05,320
The most prodigal son in the capital, he also sold his winery fields.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,040
Can I drink the wine I made? Fang Yang

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,160
I'm afraid you haven't opened your business yet

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,680
It will close down first

6
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,760
I heard that this restaurant was acquired by selling land.

7
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,960
Chen Guogong really pities Xie Ping

8
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,840
You came here to escape from being beaten today

9
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,440
Just because you don’t believe it

10
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,200
Then make a bet. What do you want to bet on?

11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,640
Bet on whose wine is better

12
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,880
We thank the family for the wine

13
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,160
Who knows the capital

14
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,200
if i win

15
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,360
You give me a beating

16
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,640
You are not allowed to complain when you go back

17
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:31,080
Just say that you fell down and you, Mr. Xie, promised him a prodigal son.

18
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,000
What good wine can I make?

19
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,000
If you lose

20
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,560
Just kneel down and ring your head three times

21
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,280
When you see me in the future, please say "Daddy, okay, young master"

22
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,880
I'll show you the big pig head later

23
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,840
He pawned all the land in his family

24
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:47,200
How dare you take wine and Xie's poison?

25
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,320
Each person picks ten people

26
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,240
Take turns bottle of wine

27
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,640
Finally let them judge twenty people

28
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,560
you are afraid

29
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:56,460
There are more people, so you won’t lose and you won’t give in.

30
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:58,580
Just say it boldly

31
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:00,340
If Fangyang dares to trouble you

32
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:02,260
I asked my father to impeach him
